sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: One change, from Kevin's ask to his phone
    accDescr: The budget bar change of 2026-11-05. Kevin asked to see what he had spent against what was left; an agent built it on a branch with the suites and screenshots, Kevin corrected it twice, the branch merged to dev and main, his own command deployed the engine and published the release, and the phone asked before it installed.
    %% Sources: git log origin/dev 2026-11-05 (66d7bf5a, 4dfb3c92, 1b051092, d7360072, 0b26ff92);
    %% tools/release_apk.py; deploy/cloudrun/deploy.py, deploy_job.py; server/releases/views.py;
    %% app/.../update/UpdateGraph.kt, UpdateController.kt; .scratch/alfred-ota/issues/05-phone-updater.md.
    actor kevin as Kevin
    participant orch as Orchestrator session
    participant agent as Agent in a worktree
    participant git as Git: dev and main
    participant cloud as Cloud Run
    participant releases as Engine /api/releases
    participant phone as Kevin's phone

    kevin->>orch: "how much ive spent this month vs how much left"
    orch->>agent: brief: one budget board, a total bar
    agent->>agent: branch, build, JVM tests, detekt, tsc -b
    agent->>agent: engine: fixed categories carry their own cap
    agent->>agent: screenshots re-recorded
    agent-->>orch: report with its assumptions ledger
    orch-->>kevin: the built bar
    kevin->>orch: "why 438 out of 1365?"
    kevin->>orch: "just show all 2830 and no need for the daily bar"
    orch->>agent: every budget in the total, no pace tick
    agent->>git: commits, merged to dev, then main
    kevin->>cloud: his ! command: deploy.py, deploy_job.py
    kevin->>releases: same command: release_apk.py checks signer and versionCode, uploads, publishes
    phone->>releases: latest release (at start, daily, after a conversation)
    releases-->>phone: newer version, signed download link
    phone->>phone: download, check sha256 and signer
    phone-->>kevin: "LEGION update ready. Install?"
    kevin->>phone: Install
    phone->>phone: installed
